{# Who flies it, busiest first, each reaching its own page.

   The count is how many of the route's upcoming flights are theirs, which is
   the one number that says who actually owns the route: British Airways flies
   69 of the 226 between New York and London and Ryanair 10, and a list in any
   other order would present those as equals. #}
<ul class="chips">
    {% for carrier in carriers %}
        <li>
            <a class="chip chip--link" href="{{ carrier.url }}">
                <img class="chip__logo"
                     src="{{ cdn(config('site.static.endpoint.images') ~ '/suppliers/' ~ carrier.code ~ '.png') }}"
                     width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" alt="">
                {{ carrier.name }}
                <span class="chip__note">{{ carrier.flights }} flights</span>
            </a>
        </li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>
